{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34222","headline":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 蓑衣 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 蓑衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山前度微雨，不废小涧渔。\n上有青襏襫，下有新腒疎。\n滴沥珠影泫，离披岚彩虚。\n君看荷制者，不得安吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}